{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Annihilation lasts its full attack count with Pit Lord's Strength",
  "contract": [
    "Annihilation 803904 (server Spell.dbc Description[enUS]): 'Lasts for $n attacks or $d.' ($n = ProcCharges 5,",
    "$d = 12000 ms). Pit Lord's Strength 802076 / 802110: 'Your Annihilation now affects $s1 additional attack' ($s1 =",
    "1 / 2, SPELLMOD_CHARGES on 803904). Expected: 5, 6 and 7 attacks.",
    "The Felsworn contract clears 803904's ProcCharges and counts the attacks in the aura's script value; the talents'",
    "SPELLMOD_CHARGES still gave the aura 1 / 2 native charges (Aura::CalcMaxCharges), which the native proc path",
    "dropped on the first landed attacks and removed the aura. Measured before the fix (scratch diagnostic, dual wield):",
    "native charges 0 / 1 / 2 at the cast, and with a talent the aura was gone after the first landed pair (count 6 / 7",
    "to 0). The fix sets the aura's native charges to 0 on apply and reapply (Felsworn ADR 0030).",
    "Each arm is its own Felsworn with one 1300 ms main-hand dagger (2208), so one attack lands per swing and the",
    "seventh lands near 9.1 s, inside the 12 s duration; hit rating and expertise remove misses, dodges and parries.",
    "After each landed attack (exactly k landed), the count must read n - k with the aura present, and the aura must be",
    "gone after the n-th. The no-talent arm is the control."
  ],
